Tool response:
Tool: update_rule
Description: Updates the rule with the specified ID to modify its condition and action JSON.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "rule_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Internal ID of the rule to update",
          "title": "Rule Id"
        },
        "condition_json": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Condition Json"
        },
        "action_json": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Action Json"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "rule_id",
        "condition_json",
        "action_json"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: apply_rule_to_warehouse
Description: Applies the specified rule to all unshipped consignments within the given warehouse 
that match the rule's conditions. This operation updates consignment records directly 
based on the rule's logic.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "rule_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Internal ID of the rule to apply",
          "title": "Rule Id"
        },
        "warehouse_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Warehouse Id"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "rule_id",
        "warehouse_id"
      ]
    }
